# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:19
translate chinese forest_63a2df02:

    # but "Good evening, sweetie. Would you like a drink?"
    but "晚上好，甜心，想喝点什么吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:34
translate chinese butmenu_e56b6e02:

    # but "You called?"
    but "你叫我？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:45
translate chinese butmenu_83a3642d:

    # but "Did you need me, sweetie?"
    but "你需要我吗，甜心？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:49
translate chinese butmenu_e2c1e9d3:

    # but "I'd love to chat. Did you have any topics in mind?"
    but "我很乐意聊聊。你有任何想聊的话题吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:53
translate chinese butmenu_f2ebe9a0:

    # but "This has been a lovely talk, but I mustn't keep you all night. Is there anything else you'd like?"
    but "这次畅谈非常愉快，但我不能留你一整晚，你还有什么想要的吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:84
translate chinese butsexmenu_93d09ad6:

    # but "Suppose we'll have to go to the farm, then!"
    but "看来我们就只能去农场了！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:134
translate chinese forest1_1e8afe02:

    # "In the other universe, this was just a peaceful forest edging the suburbs—a benign sprawl of trees and greenery that barely caught the eye."
    "在平行宇宙中，这只是在郊区边缘一片平静的森林——树和绿色植物温和的蔓延几乎不会引起人们的注意。 "

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:137
translate chinese forest1_8577ec89:

    # "But here, this is the 'Nevermore Forest,' a melting pot of myths and tales. The conclusion of most of these stories is simple: those who enter the Nevermore Forest never come back."
    "但在这，这里是无尽森林，一个神话与传说的熔炉。大多数故事的结论都很简单：那些进了无尽森林的马就再也回不来了。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:138
translate chinese forest1_474f240b:

    # "At first, I was confident. Tales like this were always spun to scare children away from wandering too far. But the real kicker, the thing that made me second-guess myself, was the guard stationed at the gate between the city and the forest."
    "一开始，我很自信。这种故事不过是拿来吓唬小孩子的罢了。但我没想到真的有卫兵站在城林交界处的大门前，这让我怀疑自己的判断。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:140
translate chinese forest1_2a089efa:

    # misc "You can go in, but if you don’t come back, no one will come after you. We won’t even list you as missing; you’ll be marked as dead."
    misc "你可以到里面去，但如果你没回来，谁都不会去找你。我们甚至都不会将你列为失踪;你会直接被标记为死亡。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:141
translate chinese forest1_ae60b67b:

    # mc "I… see… {i}Gulp{/i}"
    mc "我...知道了...{i}倒吸一口凉气{/i}"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:147
translate chinese forest1_7596442d:

    # "The guard must be exaggerating, right? I switched on my flashlight and forged ahead down a path I’d walked a thousand times before."
    "守卫一定在骗我，对吧？我打开我的手电筒并沿着一条我已走过无数次的小路前进。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:148
translate chinese forest1_5df1d5de:

    # "This was no cheerful stroll through friendly woods, with bunnies hopping and deer prancing."
    "这可不是在友好的树林里的闲庭信步，不会有兔子蹦跳、小鹿嬉戏的场景。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:149
translate chinese forest1_1ed04530:

    # "It was dark—no, not just dark, but a suffocating, almost sentient darkness. The trees pressed in on me, and each step was a careful negotiation with the beam of my flashlight."
    "黑暗笼罩着四周—不，不仅是黑暗，而且是一种令人窒息、几乎有意识的黑暗。树木正向我逼近，我每一步都要在我的手电筒的光束引导下小心翼翼地进行。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:150
translate chinese forest1_26cc8258:

    # "[but]’s house was only about ten minutes into the forest from the entrance, but in these conditions, it felt endless. And what if I took a wrong turn? In this darkness, every shadow twisted and morphed into something unfamiliar."
    "[but] 的房子离森林入口仅仅只有大约10分钟的路程，但在这种情况下，我仍然感觉像是没有尽头一样。而且万一我走错路了怎么办？在这片黑暗中，每一个影子都扭曲变形变成了陌生的东西。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:151
translate chinese forest1_9a882c1d:

    # "A few minutes in, I made the decision to turn back. It was too dark, too dangerous. I’d need to come back in the daylight if I was ever going to make sense of this place."
    "几分钟后，我决定回头，这也太黑太危险了。白天再来探索这个森林吧。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:155
translate chinese forest1_b8ec7f90:

    # "I hear the crunch of distant leaves, sending a shiver down my spine. An uncanny dread settles over me."
    "我听到远处的树叶发出嘎吱作响的声音，这让我脊椎发凉。一种莫名的恐惧笼罩着我。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:156
translate chinese forest1_194adc60:

    # "It’s an instinctual, indescribable feeling. I can tell that I’m being watched. I don’t know where, and I don’t know what, but I know."
    "这是一种本能的，难以形容的感觉。我感觉到我被什么东西注视着，但我不知道这股视线在哪，我也不知道是什么，但我就是能感觉出来。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:157
translate chinese forest1_e72e6cd9:

    # "No, it’s worse than that. Being watched by a stranger across the street is nothing compared to this. This is different—more primal, more visceral."
    "不，比那更糟糕。被街对面的陌生人注视和这相比简直是小巫见大巫。这不同—更原始，更深刻。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:158
translate chinese forest1_424e84e2:

    # "From the moment I stepped into this forest, the balance of power shifted. I was no longer at the top of the food chain. I’ve become prey. I’m being hunted."
    "从我踏入森林的那一刻起，力量的天平就发生了变化。我不再是食物链顶端。我变成了正在被狩猎的猎物"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:162
translate chinese forest1_314fced1:

    # "Abruptly, something soars through the darkened trees—could be the wind, a bird, or something far more sinister."
    "突然，有什么东西在黑暗的树梢间掠过——可能是风，可能是鸟，也可能是更险恶的东西。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:165
translate chinese forest1_6777d9e8:

    # "Something's behind me. Leaving is no longer an option. My only choice now is to push forward, hoping to reach the clearing where the cottage waits."
    "有东西正跟着我。没有回头路可走了，我现在唯一的选择就是向前冲，希望能到达小屋所在的空地。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:173
translate chinese forest1_f6df0f9a:

    # "But with each step, something closes in. The rustling intensifies, encroaching from all sides."
    "但每走一步，那东西就离我越近。沙沙声愈演愈烈，从四面八方袭来。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:176
translate chinese forest1_f21573ff:

    # "Despite bracing myself for an attack, I’m still caught off guard when something drops from above, pinning me down with a force that drives the breath from my lungs."
    "尽管我已做好了迎接攻击的准备，但当那东西从头顶袭来时，我还是措手不及，一股力量把我压在地上，让我喘不过气来。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:191
translate chinese forest1_4338b25c:

    # but "Lost, little boy?"
    but "迷路了，小男孩？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:192
translate chinese forest1_a9dd19b3:

    # "In any other context, the situation would be utterly terrifying. But right now, a flutter of relief washes over me."
    "在任何其他情况下，这种情况都会令人感到极度恐惧。但此时，我反而松了一口气。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:193
translate chinese forest1_321596ef:

    # mc "Oh, thank [aur]. I thought you were a monster."
    mc "哦，感谢[aur]。我以为你是个怪物。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:194
translate chinese forest1_8d8dbff1:

    # but "Hehe, look closer."
    but "呼呼，仔细看看。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:198
translate chinese forest1_2fdf3e2a:

    # "My shaken eyes adjust to clearly see a [but] that’s purely succubus. Seemingly further gone than her other self, with features far more prominent and imposing."
    "我调整视角仔细看了看眼前的[but]，这是一个纯粹的魅魔。她似乎比另一个世界的自己更加堕落，魅魔的特征与气质展露无遗。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:199
translate chinese forest1_de6207de:

    # "It’s like she’s evolved to a more dangerous, higher form. Her wings were dark as night, with a span thrice her body."
    "她似乎进化到了更危险，更高级的形态。她的翅膀如夜幕般深邃，展开时的翼展是她身体的三倍。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:200
translate chinese forest1_1214cbd7:

    # "Her tail snaked into view, pure black and lacking the warmth of its heart-shaped tip."
    "她的尾巴蜿蜒滑入我的视线，一同那纯黑且冰凉的心形尾尖。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:201
translate chinese forest1_40a754bd:

    # "Curiously, she has no horns. I was struck by the realization that [but] was not the same kind of demon I had expected."
    "奇怪的是，她没有角。我突然意识到 [but] 并不是我想象中的那种恶魔。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:202
translate chinese forest1_c432abd3:

    # but "It’s dangerous for you to wander these woods. If you run away now, I won’t start chasing you for at least ten seconds~"
    but "你在这林子里乱闯可太危险了。如果你现在就开始撒腿就跑，我至少会等十秒才开始追你哦~"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:203
translate chinese forest1_f6fd00e4:

    # mc "I’m not going anywhere. I came here to find you."
    mc "我哪都不去。我到这来就是为了找你。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:204
translate chinese forest1_f7112334:

    # but "Oh dear, is my reputation preceding me? To think, I’ve gone to such lengths to cover my tracks. It looks like I’ll have to deal with you myself!"
    but "哦亲爱的，看来你早就对我有所调查呢？要知道，我可是费了很大心思来掩盖自己的行踪。看来我不得不亲自处理你了。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:207
translate chinese forest1_42e63446:

    # "Her eyes flared with a sharp, unsettling red as she locked her gaze onto mine. For a few disorienting moments, I felt her attempt to ensnare me in a hypnotic grip."
    "她的双眼骤然迸发出锐利而令人不安的赤红光芒，将我的视线牢牢锁住。在几秒钟的眩晕中，我感受到她试图用催眠般的魔力将我困住。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:208
translate chinese forest1_42442f4c:

    # mc "[but], wait! I’m here to help you!"
    mc "[but]，等等！我到这是为了来帮你的！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:215
translate chinese forest1_7d1cbdf1:

    # "Startled, [but] recoiled back, her face shifting to one of concern."
    "[but] 吓得后退，她的脸上露出了担忧的表情。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:216
translate chinese forest1_c98d6c55:

    # but "You… really shouldn’t know my name. Nobody knows my name."
    but "你...不应该知道我的名字。没有马知道我的名字。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:217
translate chinese forest1_26174b69:

    # mc "I think I know how to cure your affliction, your curse."
    mc "我认为我知道如何治愈你的痛苦、你的诅咒。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:219
translate chinese forest1_76072f95:

    # but "Ahaha, what makes you think I want to be cured? I’m a demon that feasts on the energy of men like you."
    but "啊哈哈，你凭什么认为我想被治愈？我是一个以你这种雄性的精力为食的恶魔。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:220
translate chinese forest1_68c6f01b:

    # mc "I know you’re not a monster. You’re a succubus that could drain me dry in an instant, but you're clearly trying to get me to leave for my safety."
    mc "我知道你不是个怪物。你是个可以把我瞬间榨干的魅魔，但你显然是为了我的安全而让我试图离开这里。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:222
translate chinese forest1_1f8ddb80:

    # "[but]’s expression softened slightly, her ears twitching with a hint of curiosity."
    "[but] 的脸色稍微缓和了一些，她的耳朵伴随着一丝好奇抽动着。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:223
translate chinese forest1_fde9ba1a:

    # mc "And I understand that you’re wary of getting close to men because of the risks, the danger, and the compulsions you struggle with."
    mc "而且我理解你对接近雄性时持谨慎态度，是因为那些风险、危险、以及你正努力克服的欲望。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:225
translate chinese forest1_3fe0079f:

    # but "You’re right. It’s unbearable. But a cure? That would be like clipping the wings of a pegasus or sawing off a unicorn’s horn."
    but "你是对的。这简直难以忍受。但治愈？那就像剪掉天马的翅膀或者锯掉角马的角。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:226
translate chinese forest1_beff910a:

    # mc "Let me rephrase: I know of a potion that can remove your ability to drain energy during sex."
    mc "我来重新表述一下吧：我知道一种药水可以移除你在做爱时汲取生命精力的能力。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:228
translate chinese forest1_6bdcbe50:

    # but "As tempting as that sounds, why should I trust you? Why should you trust me? I don’t know how long I’ll be able to control myself around such an... attractive... male specimen."
    but "有意思，但为何我应信任你？又为何你应信任我？况且，我不知道我能在这样一个...有吸引力的...男性样本面前自控多久。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:229
translate chinese forest1_9d4e9d3d:

    # mc "I’ll tell you the ingredients, and, uh…"
    mc "我会告诉你原料，以及，呃..."

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:230
translate chinese forest1_d8c97cd8:

    # "Shiiit, what were the ingredients again? I remember where we got them from, but the names are slipping through my mind."
    "我擦，原料是啥来着？我记得该从哪拿到，但不记得具体名字是什么了。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:231
translate chinese forest1_29d897e6:

    # mc "There was some kind of gel from a slime girl… A leaf cutting from an aphrodisiacal alraune…"
    mc "史莱姆娘的凝胶...一片催情的曼德拉草的叶子..."

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:233
translate chinese forest1_a6e8f0d1:

    # but "Sounds like you're a third-rate alchemist with fourth-rate ingredients. What you're describing would make a {i}permanent{/i} aphrodisiac. Can you imagine if you gave something like that to a {i}succubus{/i}?"
    but "听起来你就像一个三流的炼金术士用着四流的原料。你描述的东西可以做成一种 {i} 长效{/i} 媚药。你能想象如果你把这种东西给了一个 {i} 魅魔{/i} 吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:234
translate chinese forest1_43dadb43:

    # mc "Ordinarily, yes, if not for the final ingredient. One you could never get yourself — the coveted Dewblossom."
    mc "通常来说，这样确实会调配出媚药，但如果加了一种原料就不同了，一种靠你自己永远无法得到的原料——朝露绽放。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:238
translate chinese forest1_ac9d987c:

    # "[but] slipped into a deep trance, her eyes darting back and forth as if chasing invisible threads of thought."
    "[but] 陷入了深思中，她的双眼如追逐无形的思绪般来回游移。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:242
translate chinese forest1_5a523d29:

    # but "Classic Dewblossom reversal… with folium polypus… an anti-aphrodisiac… Could that counter the curse?"
    but "朝露绽放的逆转效果...与曼德拉草的叶片...这能调配出一种反催情药水...这能对抗诅咒吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:246
translate chinese forest1_05c51c7d:

    # but "But with a gelatinous base… a transformation potion. In theory, it would be a potion that dramatically quells all forms of arousal."
    but "但如果以凝胶为基底的话……能调出一种转化药剂。理论上，它能极大地抑制所有形式的性兴奋。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:247
translate chinese forest1_0c341622:

    # but "Could such a thing really neutralize my draining abilities? Ah—of course! The Dewblossom’s anti-evil warding effects!"
    but "这种东西真的能消除我吸收生命力的能力吗？啊——对了！朝露绽放有驱邪效果！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:249
translate chinese forest1_0becb793:

    # but "This isn’t just an anti-aphrodisiac; this is an anti-sexual magic potion! I’ll be able to do whatever the fuck I want!"
    but "这不仅仅是一种抗媚药水；这是一种抗性欲魔法药水！这样我就能为所欲为了！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:251
translate chinese forest1_b251af6c:

    # but "You… genius! What’s your name?"
    but "你是...天才！你的名字是？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:252
translate chinese forest1_ccf0ad0c:

    # mc "You can call me [mc]. I’m not a genius. All I know are the ingredients. You’re the one who makes the magic happen."
    mc "你可以叫我 [mc]。我不是个天才，我不知道炼药的基本原理，我只知道需要什么原料，而你才是那个点石成金的天才。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:254
translate chinese forest1_74bdbbcb:

    # but "Thanks for the tip, [mc]. Now, get out of here before I pin you down again. Between you and me, my pussy is already... Well, I’m not sure how much longer I can keep up this ‘good girl’ act."
    but "感谢你的提示，[mc]，现在，在我再次把你压倒在地前，快离开吧。在你和我说话的时候，我的下面已经...咳咳，我不确定我还能保持这种“好女孩”状态多久。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:258
translate chinese forest1_bead814d:

    # "With that, [but] turned to leave, her wings flaring out in a dramatic sweep. I just stood still and waited expectantly."
    "说完，[but] 转身离开，她的翅膀在空中划出一道优雅的弧线。我静静地伫立在原地，等着她飞回来。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:260
translate chinese forest1_e7b76a32:

    # but "… Right, I can’t touch the Dewblossom, can I?"
    but "...啊，我好像是不能碰朝露绽放的，对吧？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:264
translate chinese forest1_7e29e3ce:

    # "She awkwardly skips back."
    "她尴尬地飞了回来。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:266
translate chinese forest1_0840cee4:

    # but "C-Can you come with me and help? I promise I’ll be a good girl!"
    but "你能-能来帮我吗吗？我保证我会当个好女孩，不会对你下手的！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:268
translate chinese forest1_ffabd437:

    # but "And if this potion works, I’m going to fuck your balls dry once I’ve had it~ Deal?"
    but "而且，如果你说的这种药水真的有用的话，我喝完后就把你蛋蛋给榨干~可以吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:269
translate chinese forest1_b5b1154c:

    # mc "Well, that doesn’t quite sound like the behavior of a ‘good girl,’ but I’ll gladly accept."
    mc "好吧，这听起来不像是个“好女孩”的行为，但我很乐意接受。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:275
translate chinese forest1_29a7da90:

    # "[but] led me into the familiar labyrinth of caves. I must have explored this particular network at least a dozen times while searching for ingredients. Yet, it was rare for me to be here with [but] in her succubus form."
    "[but] 带我走进了熟悉的洞穴迷宫里。以前搜寻原料的时候，我已在这片迷宫中徘徊了无数次。然而，[but]以魅魔形式同我一起到这来还是很稀罕。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:276
translate chinese forest1_ca9b79da:

    # mc "[but], I’m curious about your other self."
    mc "[but]，我对你的另一个自己很好奇。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:278
translate chinese forest1_05f4437f:

    # but "What are you talking about, newbie?"
    but "你在说什么呢，甜心？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:279
translate chinese forest1_cc04fa3e:

    # mc "Your other half, you know, before you became a…"
    mc "你的另一半，就是，在你变成那样之前..."

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:281
