# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:504
translate chinese but1_325c8c04:

    # but "No, just a regular monster. You won’t find any feral monster girls around here. We're next to a city; it's too urbanized for them to thrive."
    but "不，就是个平平无奇的怪物而已。你在这附近找不到任何野生的魔物娘。我们毗邻一座城市；城市化水平太高了以至于让她们无法繁衍生息。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:506
translate chinese but1_cb8b3d10:

    # but "Disappointed there’s no cute plant pussy for you to slide your cock in?"
    but "失望啦？是不是幻想着能和可爱的植物娘进行连接？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:507
translate chinese but1_af570bc4:

    # mc "I’d prefer to avoid the topic of sex right now."
    mc "我现在不想听你的荤段子。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:509
translate chinese but1_3e4995c5:

    # but "Your loss~ The dewblossoms are just up ahead. If I step out of line, you can give me a poke with one of them to give me a nasty jolt!"
    but "没有植物娘真可惜~朝露绽放就在前方。要是我越界了，你就用花给我来个理智回复术！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:511
translate chinese but1_ca7c7fa2:

    # "As I stepped into the dewblossom area, the sight was more lush than before. There were significantly more dewblossoms than last time, so I decided to gather a bundle."
    "当我踏入露花区时，发现眼前的景象比印象里更为葱郁。朝露绽放数量明显多了许多，于是我决定多摘几朵。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:514
translate chinese but1_60b72aec:

    # "Out of the corner of my eye, I saw [but] experimenting with one of the flowers, getting a taste of the jolt she’d mentioned."
    "我余光瞥见她正摆弄着其中一朵花，体验着她提到的那种刺痛感。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:515
translate chinese but1_e59764d1:

    # but "{i}Sigh{/i} This potion is going to be a real bitch to drink, isn’t it? I wonder if…"
    but "{i} 叹气{/i} 这药水喝起来会非常难受，不是吗？如果..."

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:516
translate chinese but1_00faf7aa:

    # "She turned to me, a frown creasing her face as if she’d just had an epiphany."
    "话音未落，她忽然转身向我，眉头微蹙，脸上浮现出一种恍然大悟的神情。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:519
translate chinese but1_72eab7b8:

    # but "Did you know my other self?"
    but "你认识我的另一个我吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:520
translate chinese but1_e1014fe5:

    # mc "In a way, you could say that. She’s the one who taught me this recipe."
    mc "某种程度上，你可以这么说，就是她教了我这个配方。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:522
translate chinese but1_53c17d72:

    # but "And here I was calling you a kid. Guess that makes you an old man."
    but "我当时还叫你小男孩呢。看来你的年龄恐怕也不小了。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:523
translate chinese but1_ce2c99b3:

    # mc "Hey, I’m not old either!"
    mc "嘿，我看着也没那么老吧！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:525
translate chinese but1_41414183:

    # but "The other me, the ‘original’ self, if you will… She couldn’t come to terms with what happened."
    but "另一个我，“原初”的自我...她始终无法接受所发生的一切。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:526
translate chinese but1_54e7772a:

    # mc "When you were afflicted by the succubus curse?"
    mc "无法接受被诅咒的现实？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:528
translate chinese but1_5bb8e769:

    # but "That’s right. Before then, I was a different person. Loving, motherly innocent… She was tricked, betrayed, twisted."
    but "对的。在那之前，我是另一幅模样。充满爱心，像慈母般仁爱...但....她被欺骗，背叛，扭曲了。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:530
translate chinese but1_3d094d0a:

    # but "She rejected reality and buried herself deep inside."
    but "她拒绝面对现实并把自己深深地藏在了内心深处。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:531
translate chinese but1_a40ff816:

    # but "Now I’m… this. And I’ve been like this far longer than I was ever my original self…"
    but "而现在的...我，以这种方式存在的时间，早已超过了她存在的时间..."

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:533
translate chinese but1_0c11df38:

    # but "This… new me… is it a ‘succubus’ side, or just a new personality created to distance her from the monster she’d become?"
    but "这...新的我..魅魔的一面，或只是为了同她所变成的怪物保持距离而创造的新的性格？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:534
translate chinese but1_2953bd2b:

    # mc "Why did you refuse to tell me earlier?"
    mc "为什么你不早点和我说呢？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:536
translate chinese but1_fa51c59d:

    # but "{i}Sigh{/i} It’s just… I’m not sure if she’s there anymore…"
    but "{i} 叹气{/i} 我只是...我不确定她是否还在那...所以....."

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:537
translate chinese but1_97e7cd93:

    # but "A part of me feels like she might be lost forever. It’s not that I was hiding it from you; it’s just… I might be all that’s left."
    but "我认为她有可能已经永远离开了。我不是我向你隐瞒什么；只是...也许真的只剩下我了。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:539
translate chinese but1_acba5f9e:

    # but "I mourn for her. I always have."
    but "我为她感到悲痛，一直如此。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:542
translate chinese but1_6a0403ec:

    # "I drop the dewblossom and pull [but] into a tight hug. She clung to me like she never wanted to let go."
    "我放下了花束，上前紧紧抱住了[but] ，她也紧紧抱住了我，似乎永远都不想松手。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:548
translate chinese but1_70e18626:

    # but "Hugging a succubus… You’re a stupid kind of brave."
    but "拥抱一个魅魔...有点笨，但又有点勇敢。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:549
translate chinese but1_cfc5a03c:

    # mc "You needed one. Doesn’t matter what you are."
    mc "不管你是不是魅魔，你都需要一个拥抱。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:551
translate chinese but1_699a7055:

    # mc "Now come on, we’re almost there. We’ve only got one ingredient left to find."
    mc "该走了，还差一种原料，我们就快成功了"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:553
translate chinese but1_c91f5427:

    # but "Right, let’s get that gelatine."
    but "好，我们去搞到凝胶吧。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:557
translate chinese but1_04f3ae85:

    # "I led us deeper into the cave, toward a damp, shadowy section where an underground lake lay hidden. It was the perfect habitat for the elusive slimes. It may take a while to find one hidden in this darkness."
    "我领着她向着洞穴深处走去，来到一个阴暗潮湿的地方，那里藏着个地下湖。这里对于难以捉摸的史莱姆来说是个完美的栖息地。要找到一个藏在这种黑暗中的史莱姆还是要花点时间的。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:561
translate chinese but1_aa5b4d67:

    # but "Got one."
    but "抓到一个。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:562
translate chinese but1_4ff64fbb:

    # "[but] glides into view and lifts up a blue blob."
    "[but] 飘然现身并举起一个蓝色的斑点。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:563
translate chinese but1_5fc88986:

    # mc "Wha— but we just got here!"
    mc "什——但我们才刚到这里！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:565
translate chinese but1_6d34ac02:

    # but "Yeah, while you were busy marveling at the view, I went ahead and grabbed some."
    but "嗯哼~，当你还在沉浸在这片美景时，我就已经开始找了。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:566
translate chinese but1_0a949d2b:

    # mc "Wow, alright then! Let’s head back to your cottage!"
    mc "可以啊！那我们回你的小屋去吧！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:568
translate chinese but1_929ccbe5:

    # but "Right… Let’s go."
    but "好…我们走吧。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:570
translate chinese but1_d51e66b3:

    # "[but] guided me back to her house. Despite the fact that [but] had been so different for so long, the cabin’s interior was brimming with familiarity and nostalgia."
    "[but]带我回到她的小屋里。尽管[but]和我印象里的她已经不太一样了，但小屋内依然洋溢着一种熟悉的怀旧感。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:572
translate chinese but1_2f2bce14:

    # "Quietly, [but] brushed past me, her demeanor subdued as she began to prepare her equipment. Since we got the gelatine, the chatter and banter had all but disappeared."
    "片刻间，[but] 从我身边擦肩而过，开始准备她的炼金设备，动作淡然而内敛。自从我们回来后，欢声笑语就几近消失殆尽。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:574
translate chinese but1_750d35c9:

    # but "You can prepare the dewblossom for me."
    but "你可以去帮我处理一下朝露绽放。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:575
translate chinese but1_ab87bfb1:

    # mc "Could you show me how?"
    mc "你能告诉我该怎么做吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:577
translate chinese but1_5a071d31:

    # but "Oh, you don’t know that part? I thought you knew everything."
    but "啊，你不知道该怎么处理它吗？我以为你什么都知道呢。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:578
translate chinese but1_34cec937:

    # mc "Is something wrong?"
    mc "这有什么问题吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:580
translate chinese but1_ea104ef9:

    # but "How did you know I had a house here? I can tell you knew the way. Hell, the interior of the caves too. You often wouldn’t even wait for my directions."
    but "那你怎么知道我在这有座小屋的？我看得出来你很熟悉来这的路。天呐，就连洞穴内部该怎么走你都了如指掌。你甚至都不用我来帮你探路。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:582
translate chinese but1_861dbc40:

    # but "I was focused on gathering ingredients, so I let you get away with vague answers, but too much has built up. I told you who I am; now I need to know who or what you really are."
    but "我一直专心于收集素材，所以对你那含糊其辞的回答暂且放过，但问题越积越多了。我已经告诉过你我是谁了;现在我要知道你真正是谁。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:583
translate chinese but1_3416a576:

    # mc "I’ve never been particularly good at lying, so I’ll give you the complete truth."
    mc "我从来都不擅长撒谎，所以我会告诉你完整的真相。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:584
translate chinese but1_11a496ce:

    # mc "It’s because… I did know the way. I’ve been here countless times, hunting for ingredients in those very caves, all with a different you in another universe."
    mc "这是因为…我确实知道路。我曾无数次到过这里，在那些洞穴中搜寻素材，每一次都是在平行宇宙中与另一个你同行。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:586
translate chinese but1_10f79e58:

    # but "That’s the craziest thing I’ve ever heard, and yet, I’d be a fool to doubt it."
    but "这是我听过最离谱的事，可若因此怀疑它，那我才真是傻瓜。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:588
translate chinese but1_22cea222:

    # but "Even knowing the risks, you really came here to help me?"
    but "即使知道魅魔的危险性，你依然愿意来这里帮助我？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:589
translate chinese but1_af77e969:

    # mc "How could I not? You’re [but], one of my best friends."
    mc "我怎能不来？你是 [but]，我最好的朋友之一啊。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:591
translate chinese but1_fd564542:

    # but "Nnghh… You’re going to make me blush…"
    but "唔~…你要把我说脸红了…"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:593
translate chinese but1_5bf1aa60:

    # but "The me in the other universe—she was my ‘other self,’ wasn’t she? Can you tell me what she was like?"
    but "平行宇宙的我——她是我的“另一个我”，对吧？你能告诉我她是什么样子吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:594
translate chinese but1_fce11ed7:

    # mc "You already know, perhaps better than I do. Because you are her; innocent, caring, motherly."
    mc "你已经知道了，也许比我还清楚。因为你就是她，无邪，仁爱，如慈母一般。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:595
translate chinese but1_5e91f761:

    # mc "This house, it’s a mirror image of hers. You have a lot more in common with your original self than you realize."
    mc "这里的内设，可以说和她的屋子一模一样。你和她的共同点比你意识到的多的多。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:598
translate chinese but1_2bdb994a:

    # "[but] began to brew the potion, gesturing for me to drop the dewblossoms in whole."
    "[but] 开始酿制药剂，示意我把整株朝露绽放放进去。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:600
translate chinese but1_cc84f976:

    # but "Mmhh… I guess we’ll find out~"
    but "嗯...我觉得我们会弄清楚的~"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:601
translate chinese but1_04df3048:

    # but "It’ll take a few hours to brew this, and even longer for it to take effect once I’ve drunk it."
    but "酿药要几个小时的时间，而我喝完后还要花更长的时间才能它的发挥药效。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:603
translate chinese but1_06de0563:

    # but "But you’ll come back, won’t you?"
    but "但你会回来的，对吧？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:604
translate chinese but1_70dd0222:

    # mc "To get my ‘balls completely drained’? Wouldn’t miss that for the world."
    mc "为什么不呢？我还记得你的承诺，我可不会错过这种美事。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:606
translate chinese but1_bef8371b:

    # but "Thank you so much, [mc]. I better hurry up and escort you out before I lose control again~"
    but "非常感谢你，[mc]。我最好还是赶快把你送出去吧，免得我再次失控~"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:609
translate chinese but1_94afc9b5:

    # "Ten minutes later, I stepped outside the forest, passing through the guarded gate once again."
    "十分钟后，我走出了森林，再次穿过了守卫森严的大门。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:610
translate chinese but1_8b93ecaa:

    # misc "Well, I’ll be damned. You actually made it back."
    misc "女王在上。你居然回来了。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:611
translate chinese but1_2d299b61:

    # mc "The stories are overrated, man. The forest isn’t that bad."
    mc "那些故事都被夸大了，伙计。森林并没有那么可怕。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:612
translate chinese but1_81d66af2:

    # misc "Guess you didn’t run into any giant bears."
    misc "我猜你没有肯定没有碰到巨熊。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:613
translate chinese but1_543e5827:

    # mc "Giant wha?!"
    mc "巨啥？！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:616
translate chinese but1_3f7f25c2:

    # "Back in [mox]’s apartment…"
    "回到 [mox] 的公寓..."

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:618
translate chinese but1_629807eb:

    # mox "Yep, there are giant, nocturnal bears in the Nevermore Forest. I can’t believe you went in there alone!"
    mox "是的，无尽森林里有巨大的夜行熊。我真不敢相信你独自进去了！"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:619
translate chinese but1_602d59db:

    # mc "Luckily, I only walked a few minutes in before I made contact with [but]."
    mc "我挺幸运的，我只走了几分钟就遇到了 [but] 。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:621
translate chinese but1_2c50494d:

    # mox "Ah, you were just at the city outskirts, then. Phew! The Nevermore Forest stretches for miles. You’d have to walk a considerable distance before you encountered anything truly dangerous."
    mox "啊，那你应该还在市郊里。无尽森林绵延数里，想遇到这种东西，你还得走很长一段路呢。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:622
translate chinese but1_f9e2faea:

    # mox "But I’ve heard that the real danger lies in the forest’s heart—an independent section of ‘dark lands’, where an ancient castle lies in ruins."
    mox "但我听说森林的中心有一片更为危险的区域——“黑暗之地”，那里废墟里矗立着一座古老的荒废城堡。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:623
translate chinese but1_0b9b53a8:

    # mc "More about these ‘Dark Lands’? I’m still trying to wrap my head around it. Would it be alright if I asked a few questions?"
    mc "能跟我多说一说黑暗之地的事情吗？我没怎么听明白，可以回答我几个问题吗？"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:625
translate chinese but1_394d93d2:

    # mox "I lost my village to it, so I can give you an accurate account, though not a pleasant one."
    mox "嗯，虽然我的家乡因此而毁灭，回忆起来并不愉快，但我还是会为你解答问题。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:629
translate chinese fo1m1_aab4c464:

    # mox "The Dark Lands is like a creeping blight, a corruption slowly devouring the country. It covers about 10%% of the globe, and roughly 33%% of our island. The west is completely lost—cities like Maplewood and Cloud Harbor."
    mox "黑暗之地犹如蔓延的瘟疫，正以腐蚀之势吞噬着这片土地。它覆盖了全球约10%的区域，腐蚀了我们近三分之一的疆域。西部已彻底沦陷—— Maplewood镇 与 Cloud港 等城市皆已消失。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:630
translate chinese fo1m1_67c7a2b6:

    # mox "Right now, the darkness is encroaching further west across the seas, threatening other countries, and gradually moving towards Arcadia, which sits at the centre of the country, also called Arcadia – confusing, I know."
    mox "现在，黑暗正越过海洋向西蚕食，威胁着其他国家，并逐渐向着Arcadia移动，这个国家的中心，也叫Arcadia——我知道这个听着有点绕。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:631
translate chinese fo1m1_1bdea631:

    # mox "[aur] pours a significant amount of her power into holding it back, but this only slows its advance. It’s like trying to stop an avalanche with a shovel."
    mox "[aur] 耗费了她大量的力量来阻止它，但这只会减缓它腐蚀的速度，如同杯水车薪。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:632
translate chinese fo1m1_e802736d:

    # mox "Tensions are sky-high. The country is practically at war, and we’re even receiving international aid from the Dragon Lands."
    mox "局势十分严峻。整个国家几乎处于战争状态，而我们甚至还在接受来自龙国的国际援助。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:636
translate chinese fo1m1_7b6ef766:

    # mox "The first thing that hits you is a suffocating darkness. It’s like a night that drags on forever, but not just any night. It’s an unnatural void that defies the sun."
    mox "里面很黑，没有任何光线，就像一个极夜一样，但绝非普通的极夜，这是一种无视太阳的不自然的非自然区域。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:637
translate chinese fo1m1_6c584e0d:

    # mox "And within those shadows, hostile nightmares appear and attack on sight."
    mox "而在这些阴影中生活着梦魇，它们会在阴影之中突然出现，袭击一切偶然进入生物。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:638
translate chinese fo1m1_c077b243:

    # mox "If you die in the shadow lands, you become one of those nightmares, twisted and..."
    mox "如果你死在了里面，你会被同化成梦魇的员，扭曲并..."

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:640
translate chinese fo1m1_d71cd5a0:

    # "[mox] faltered, breaking out in a cold sweat. She took a moment to compose herself."
    "[mox] 颤抖着，冷汗直冒。她花了一点时间才让自己冷静下来。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:642
translate chinese fo1m1_3660710d:

    # mox "Sorry. I can’t describe it properly."
    mox "抱歉。我无法正确地描述它。"

# game/4.4 - Forest Route.rpy:643
